      "beat_id": "B03",
      "act": "MECHANISM",
      "narration_text": "The rule is short. The pilot uses only its own Clerk, its own Supabase project, its own analytics and its own server, with test accounts only. Never a production or dev key. Never read or write a live service. And the line written for agents especially: if a task seems to need live data, stop and ask a human. Don't work around it.",
